    <Major>Magic training spell</Major>
    <Description>This spell makes your oponents freeze. This macro auto-type the spell Glacius that can freeze your oponents. You can link this macro to a key on your keyboard, so when you press it, the spell will be auto-typed in the chat.</Description>
